    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawl: Assemble Your Trio and Conquer the Depths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A command-based dungeon crawler where you build a team of three adventurers to challenge a randomly generated labyrinth. Each run offers a new layout, with unpredictable item spawns, equipment drops, and buffs to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three character types \u2014 <strong>Balanced</strong>, <strong>Explorer</strong>, or <strong>Combat Specialist</strong> \u2014 and select a weapon class: <strong>Swordsman</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, or <strong>Mage</strong>. Strengthen your party through <strong>item synthesis</strong>, <strong>skill acquisition</strong>, and <strong>leveling up</strong> as you descend ever deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters, gather treasure, and defeat the final boss awaiting on the lowest floor to claim your place among the high scorers. Every decision counts in this roguelike adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawl: Assemble Your Trio and Conquer the Depths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A command-based dungeon crawler where you build a team of three adventurers to challenge a randomly generated labyrinth. Each run offers a new layout, with unpredictable item spawns, equipment drops, and buffs to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three character types \u2014 <strong>Balanced</strong>, <strong>Explorer</strong>, or <strong>Combat Specialist</strong> \u2014 and select a weapon class: <strong>Swordsman</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, or <strong>Mage</strong>. Strengthen your party through <strong>item synthesis</strong>, <strong>skill acquisition</strong>, and <strong>leveling up</strong> as you descend ever deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters, gather treasure, and defeat the final boss awaiting on the lowest floor to claim your place among the high scorers. Every decision counts in this roguelike adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "The second original game by Kusanohito Channel!! Form a team of unique characters and conquer a fully randomly generated dungeon! Use the items you find along the way to defeat the powerful boss waiting in the deepest level!",
